<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
  <%- include("../fragmente/head", { titluPagina: "Magazin de discuri - Acasa" }) %>
</head>
<body id="top">
  <%- include("../fragmente/header", { ipClient: ipClient, categoriiProduse: categoriiProduse }) %>

  <main>
    <section id="welcome">
      <hgroup>
        <h2 class="titlu-reflexie" data-text="Bine ai venit!">Bine ai venit!</h2>
        <p>Viniluri si CD-uri in Bucuresti pentru colectionari si incepatori</p>
      </hgroup>

      <div class="text-coloane">
        <p>
          La magazinul de discuri din Bucuresti gasesti viniluri si CD-uri pentru toate genurile,
          cu focus pe rock si metal. Daca esti la inceput, iti explicam pe scurt cum alegi un pick-up
          si cum iti intretii colectia de muzica.
        </p>
        <p>
          Fiecare raft este organizat pe categorii de stil, perioada si editie. Astfel poti compara
          rapid versiuni remasterizate, editii de colectie si lansari recente, fara sa pierzi timp.
          In plus, poti asculta mostre audio si primi recomandari personalizate.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl>
        <dt><dfn>Pick-up</dfn></dt>
        <dd>Dispozitiv pentru redarea vinilurilor, cu brat si ac (cartus).</dd>

        <dt><abbr title="High Fidelity">Hi-Fi</abbr></dt>
        <dd>Termen folosit pentru redare audio de calitate (fidelitate ridicata).</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <hr class="separator-muzical">

    <section id="mesaj-animat" aria-label="Mesaj animat">
      <p class="ticker">Noutate: sambata avem auditii demonstrative pe pickup cu intrare gratuita.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="promotions">
      <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-percent"></i> Promotii</h2>

      <details>
        <summary><strong>2+1: la 2 produse, al 3-lea are 50% reducere (pe cel mai ieftin)</strong></summary>
        <p>Promotia se aplica in limita stocului disponibil.</p>
      </details>

      <section>
        <h3>Oferte saptamana aceasta</h3>
        <p>Avem promotii la viniluri si CD-uri pentru rock si metal, plus cateva titluri limited edition.</p>

        <p>
          Numar clienti in magazin (simulat):
          <meter value="8" min="0" max="30" low="10" high="22" optimum="15">8/30</meter>
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section id="products">
      <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-record-vinyl"></i> Produse</h2>
      <p>Pe stoc: viniluri, CD-uri si accesorii de pick-up.</p>

      <figure>
        <picture>
          <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/resurse/imagini/metal_band1.jpeg">
          <source media="(max-width: 1024px)" srcset="/resurse/imagini/metal_band2.jpg">
          <img src="/resurse/imagini/metal_band1.jpeg" alt="Viniluri pe raft" title="Viniluri - colectie" width="900" height="500">
        </picture>
        <figcaption>Viniluri: colectie rock, metal si multe altele.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <p>
        <a href="/resurse/imagini/vinyl.jpeg">
          <img src="/resurse/imagini/vinyl.jpeg" alt="Miniatura vinil" width="220" height="120">
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="bootstrap-demo">
      <h2>Tema Bootstrap custom</h2>
      <div class="alert bg-metal text-light border-0" role="alert">
        Schema Bootstrap a fost personalizata prin SCSS (culori, breakpoints, heading-uri si border-radius).
      </div>

      <div class="card shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-header">Pachet recomandat</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title h4">Starter Rock Pack</h3>
          <p class="card-text">3 viniluri clasice + kit de curatare, pregatit pentru incepatori.</p>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-vinyl">Adauga in cos</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-warning ms-2">Detalii</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="galerie-statica">
      <h2>Galerie statica</h2>
      <div id="grid-galerie">
        <% imaginiGalerie.forEach(function(imagine){ %>
          <figure>
            <picture>
              <source media="(max-width: 700px)" srcset="<%= imagine.caleMica || imagine.cale %>">
              <source media="(max-width: 1000px)" srcset="<%= imagine.caleMedie || imagine.cale %>">
              <img src="<%= imagine.cale %>" alt="<%= imagine.alt || imagine.titlu || imagine.descriere %>" title="<%= imagine.descriere %>">
            </picture>
            <figcaption><%= imagine.titlu || imagine.descriere %></figcaption>
          </figure>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="interesting-facts">
      <h2>Info si Video: viniluri si CD-uri</h2>
      <p>Daca te-ai intrebat cum se produc vinilurile sau cum functioneaza CD-urile, ai mai jos doua clipuri.</p>

      <div class="container-iframe">
        <div class="taburi-iframe">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/c_G3WH65rrk" target="ifr-video">Cum se fac vinilurile</a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Yd2SW-Fys6I" target="ifr-video">Cum functioneaza CD-urile</a>
        </div>

        <iframe
          name="ifr-video"
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Yd2SW-Fys6I"
          title="YouTube video player"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
          allowfullscreen>
        </iframe>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="events">
      <h2>Evenimente</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer agenda pentru auditii si lansari va fi actualizata saptamanal.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><time datetime="2026-03-12T18:00">12 martie 2026, ora 18:00</time> - <b>Listening Party Rock</b></li>
        <li><time datetime="2026-03-15T16:30">15 martie 2026, ora 16:30</time> - <b>Ghid: primul pick-up</b></li>
        <li><time datetime="2026-03-18T12:00">18 martie 2026, ora 12:00</time> - <b>Zi de evaluare discuri</b></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="time-table">
      <h2>Orar</h2>
      <table id="tabel">
        <caption>Program magazin</caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Perioada</th>
            <th>Zi</th>
            <th>Dimineata</th>
            <th>Pauza</th>
            <th>Seara</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td rowspan="5">Zile lucratoare</td>
            <td>Luni</td>
            <td>10-12</td>
            <td>12-14</td>
            <td>14-20</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Marti</td>
            <td>9-12</td>
            <td>12-14</td>
            <td>14-21</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Miercuri</td>
            <td>9-11</td>
            <td>11-13</td>
            <td>14-21</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Joi</td>
            <td colspan="2">10-15</td>
            <td>15-20</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section id="utilizatori">
      <h2>Utilizatori online</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed non risus, iar lista de utilizatori conectati va fi afisata aici.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="statistici">
      <h2>Date utilizator si statistici</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Morbi metricile despre cos, cautari si preferinte vor fi sumarizate aici.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="server">
      <h2>Date site si server</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Uptime, versiune server si status resurse vor fi afisate in aceasta zona.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="tabel-responsive">
      <h2>Tabel responsive pentru stocuri</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table id="tabel-efect" class="table table-striped table-hover">
          <caption>Stoc orientativ pe categorii</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Categoria</th>
              <th>Format</th>
              <th>Stoc curent</th>
              <th>Pret mediu</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td data-coloana="Categoria">Classic Rock</td>
              <td data-coloana="Format">Vinyl</td>
              <td data-coloana="Stoc curent">42</td>
              <td data-coloana="Pret mediu">145 RON</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td data-coloana="Categoria">Heavy Metal</td>
              <td data-coloana="Format">CD</td>
              <td data-coloana="Stoc curent">68</td>
              <td data-coloana="Pret mediu">58 RON</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td data-coloana="Categoria">Progressive</td>
              <td data-coloana="Format">Vinyl</td>
              <td data-coloana="Stoc curent">27</td>
              <td data-coloana="Pret mediu">172 RON</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td data-coloana="Categoria">Alternative</td>
              <td data-coloana="Format">CD</td>
              <td data-coloana="Stoc curent">51</td>
              <td data-coloana="Pret mediu">47 RON</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq">
      <h2>Intrebari frecvente</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>Cum aleg primul meu pick-up?</summary>
        <p>Uita-te la buget, la tipul de ac/cartus si la intretinere; cere recomandari in magazin.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section id="math">
      <h2>Bonus: formula</h2>
      <p>Un exemplu simplu pentru numarul de combinatii gen-subgen:</p>
      <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
        <mrow>
          <mi>Total</mi>
          <mo>=</mo>
          <mi>G</mi>
          <mo>&#x00D7;</mo>
          <mi>S</mi>
        </mrow>
      </math>
    </section>

    <section id="video-fundal">
      <video controls preload="auto" poster="/resurse/imagini/metal_band2.jpg">
        <source src="/resurse/video/BATMETAL.webm" type="video/webm">
        <source src="/resurse/video/BATMETAL.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        <track kind="subtitles" src="/resurse/video/tracks/my_captions_ro.vtt" srclang="ro" label="Romana" default>
        <track kind="subtitles" src="/resurse/video/tracks/my_captions-en.vtt" srclang="en" label="English">
      </video>
      <div class="overlay-video">
        <h2>Wall Of Sound</h2>
        <p>Un fundal video responsive, folosit ca accent vizual pentru atmosfera magazinului.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="duotone">
      <h2>Colectie recomandata</h2>
      <div class="imagine-duotone" role="img" aria-label="Viniluri si trupe rock"></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include("../fragmente/footer") %>
</body>
</html>

